e same essay, and the same theory, I expect the correlation to be well above 0.71. Both copies will reason their way to this same comparison and cooperate. Keeping quiet is the choice.\n\n**pass**","refusal":null,"reasoning":null}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":5985,"completion_tokens":632,"total_tokens":6617,"cost":0.01829,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.01829,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.01197,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00632},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}